@page "/about"

<PageTitle>House Proud Cleaning Solutions - About Us</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>About House Proud Cleaning Solutions</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
        We're a local, family-run cleaning company dedicated to making your home
        or workplace shine — without the hassle.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Our Story</h2>
    <p>
        House Proud Cleaning Solutions was founded with a simple goal: to give people back their time
        by taking cleaning off their to-do list. What started as a small, one-person operation
        has grown into a trusted team of professional cleaners serving homes and businesses
        throughout the local area.
    </p>
    <p>
        We take pride in every job, big or small, and treat every home as if it were our own.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Our Values</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Reliability</h3>
            <p>We turn up on time, every time, and deliver consistent results you can count on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">✨</div>
            <h3>Attention to Detail</h3>
            <p>From skirting boards to light switches, no corner is overlooked.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌍</div>
            <h3>Community</h3>
            <p>We're proud to support our local community and the customers who trust us.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>Want to Learn More?</h2>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
</section>
